<meta name="twitter:title" content="ORA Cafe — All-day brunch on Waiyaki Way"><meta name="twitter:description" content="All-day brunch, halal menu and a shaded patio in Nairobi."><meta property="og:image" content="https://pub-bb2e103a32db4e198524a2e9ed8f35b4.r2.dev/lovp_5660m5sdgz9aqby0vzmtjbcfvt/535c375a2f7bc5afa3fab4ed6ea9745c_1792475040338.png"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://pub-bb2e103a32db4e198524a2e9ed8f35b4.r2.dev/lovp_5660m5sdgz9aqby0vzmtjbcfvt/535c375a2f7bc5afa3fab4ed6ea9745c_1792475040338.png"></head><body><!--$--><div class="pb-20 md:pb-0"><header class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-6"><span class="font-display text-2xl italic">ora.</span><nav class="hidden gap-8 text-sm text-muted-foreground md:flex"><a href="https://ora-brunch-table-guide.lovable.app/#menu" class="hover:text-foreground">Menu</a><a href="https://ora-brunch-table-guide.lovable.app/#room" class="hover:text-foreground">The room</a><a href="https://ora-brunch-table-guide.lovable.app/#visit" class="hover:text-foreground">Hours</a><a href="https://ora-brunch-table-guide.lovable.app/#reserve" class="hover:text-foreground">Reserve</a></nav></header><section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-10 text-center"><div class="relative mx-auto w-64 sm:w-80"><svg viewBox="0 0 320 200" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full text-clay" fill="none"><path class="ring-draw" d="M60 108 C 52 50, 150 26, 222 40 C 296 54, 300 140, 220 162 C 150 182, 62 168, 54 116 C 50 90, 80 66, 120 56" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg><h1 class="relative py-14 text-center text-7xl italic sm:text-8xl">ora.</h1></div><p class="eyebrow mt-6">Cafe · Waiyaki Way, Nairobi</p><p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-md text-lg text-muted-foreground">All-day brunch, a halal menu and a shaded patio. Come slowly.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground">4.6 from 198 Google reviews</p><a href="https://ora-brunch-table-guide.lovable.app/#reserve" class="mt-10 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary px-8 py-3 text-sm text-primary-foreground transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">Request a table</a></section><section id="menu" class="border-t border-border"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20"><p class="eyebrow">Menu</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl">Simple, made well</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Fully halal. Brunch served all day.</p><div class="mt-12 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-3"><div><h3 class="border-b border-border pb-3 text-2xl italic">Brunch, all day</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-5"><li><p class="font-medium">Shakshuka</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Eggs baked in spiced tomato, warm bread</p></li><li><p class="font-medium">Avocado toast</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Sourdough, chilli, lime, soft egg</p></li><li><p class="font-medium">Buttermilk pancakes</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Berries, honey butter</p></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="border-b border-border pb-3 text-2xl italic">Plates</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-5"><li><p class="font-medium">Grilled chicken bowl</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Rice, greens, garlic yoghurt</p></li><li><p class="font-medium">Beef burger</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Brioche, caramelised onion, fries</p></li><li><p class="font-medium">Pasta of the day</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Ask the team</p></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="border-b border-border pb-3 text-2xl italic">Cups</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-5"><li><p class="font-medium">Espresso &amp; milk drinks</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Single origin, oat on request</p></li><li><p class="font-medium">Fresh juices</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Pressed daily</p></li><li><p class="font-medium">Iced tea &amp; lemonade</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">House-made</p></li></ul></div></div><a href="https://www.ubereats.com/ke/search?q=ORA%20Cafe" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-12 inline-block text-sm underline underline-offset-4">Order on Uber Eats</a></div></section><section class="bg-secondary"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20"><p class="eyebrow">What guests love</p><div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3"><div><h3 class="text-3xl italic">The food</h3><p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">Generous brunch plates that guests come back for.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-3xl italic">The service</h3><p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">Friendly, attentive staff who make it easy to linger.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-3xl italic">The space</h3><p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">A calm room and a shaded patio, good for slow mornings and meetings.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="room" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24 text-center"><p class="eyebrow">The room</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl">Wood, light and quiet corners</h2><p class="mt-6 text-muted-foreground">Indoors for long conversations and laptop mornings; outside, a shaded patio for coffee in the open air.</p></section><section id="visit" class="border-t border-border"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-12 px-6 py-20 md:grid-cols-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">Hours</p><dl class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-lg"><div class="flex justify-between border-b border-border pb-3"><dt>Mon – Fri</dt><dd>7am – 10pm</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between border-b border-border pb-3"><dt>Sat – Sun</dt><dd>8am – 11pm</dd></div></dl></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Find us</p><p class="mt-6 text-lg">Waiyaki Way, Nairobi</p><p class="mt-2"><a href="tel:+254114234107" class="underline underline-offset-4">+254 114 234 107</a></p><p class="mt-2"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/oracafe.ke/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-4">@oracafe.ke</a></p></div></div></section><section id="reserve" class="bg-secondary"><div class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-6 py-20"><p class="eyebrow">Reserve</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl">Request a table</h2><form class="mt-8 grid gap-4"><input r